# ── 3. CI workflow definitions ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A workflow holds the deploy token and decides what runs before a merge. Both halves
# matter: a job added here can exfiltrate a secret, and a job REMOVED here silently ends
# a guarantee the repository still claims to have.
